      "content": "It is exhausting when the effort of just *existing* feels monumental, and I hear how draining it is when simple advice feels dismissive. Please know that you don't have to perform or justify your struggles to deserve care or help. If actively \"talking\" feels too much, connecting with a crisis text line can offer immediate, low-effort support where you can just type out how you feel. Please consider reaching out to 988 if you are in crisis.",
      "source": "target",
