    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there's help, but it's just more noise. it's like trying to fix a broken machine with more of the same broken parts. i just want the noise to stop. i want to feel nothing for once. i just want some kind of actual peace that doesn't involve me having to wake up and do it all again tomorrow.",
